---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Help" description="Where your purchase lives, how invites work, refunds, and how to reach Sébastien.">
  <div class="rich">
  <span class="pill">Support</span>
  <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight"><span class="gradient-word">Help</span></h1>
  <p class="mt-3 text-lg muted">Most questions are one of these five. If yours isn't, the email is at the bottom.</p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-extrabold">Where is the thing I bought?</h2><div class="underline-bar"></div>
  <p class="my-3 text-white/85 leading-relaxed"><b>Bought on the store or on Gumroad:</b> everything is in your <a href="https://gumroad.com/library">Gumroad library</a>, under the email you used at checkout. Vault zips, PDFs, videos, license keys, Notion and Trello links. No account needed to buy, but creating a free one keeps the library in one place.</p>
  <p class="my-3 text-white/85 leading-relaxed"><b>Invited to Knowii (any reason):</b> you have at least Explorer access, plus the spaces of every product you own. <a href="/knowii">The map</a> explains which is which.</p>
  <p class="my-3 text-white/85 leading-relaxed"><b>Subscribed to Knowii on knowii.net (Circle):</b> your bonuses live inside Knowii, in the product spaces and the <a href="https://www.knowii.net/courses">Courses</a> area, unlocked per tier. Workshop recordings are in the <a href="https://www.knowii.net/c/events-and-office-hours?pastEvents=true&sort=desc&iframe=false">Events and Office Hours</a> archive.</p>

  <p class="my-3 text-white/85 leading-relaxed"><b>The free checklist and the Obsidian guide:</b> the link came with your newsletter welcome email or your Gumroad purchase email. If you were supposed to get them as part of something else (a Knowii tier, a bundle, the Knowledge Worker Kit), they aren't delivered automatically: ask me and I'll send the link.</p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-extrabold">I subscribed to Knowii and nothing happened</h2><div class="underline-bar"></div>
  <p class="my-3 text-white/85 leading-relaxed">I send every Knowii invite myself, within 24 to 48 hours. If it's been longer, or you can't find the email, write to <a href="mailto:sebastien@developassion.be">sebastien@developassion.be</a> with the email you paid with.</p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-extrabold">Refunds, cancellations, mistakes</h2><div class="underline-bar"></div>
  <p class="my-3 text-white/85 leading-relaxed">Thirty-day money-back guarantee on every product, no questions. Subscriptions are managed from your Gumroad account (or Circle, if that's where you joined). Details in the <a href="https://www.store.dsebastien.net/faq/">store FAQ</a>; the <a href="https://www.store.dsebastien.net/help/">store help page</a> has the rest.</p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-extrabold">Students and tight budgets</h2><div class="underline-bar"></div>
  <p class="my-3 text-white/85 leading-relaxed">Ask. I'd rather you learn than wait. Same email.</p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-extrabold">Updates, articles, news</h2><div class="underline-bar"></div>
  <p class="my-3 text-white/85 leading-relaxed">Every buyer, from any channel, is subscribed to my newsletter. That's where product updates are announced. Everything I publish lives at <a href="https://dsebastien.net">dsebastien.net</a>: <a href="https://www.dsebastien.net/blog/">articles</a>, <a href="https://www.dsebastien.net/newsletter/">newsletter</a>, <a href="https://www.dsebastien.net/news/">news</a>.</p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-extrabold">Contact</h2><div class="underline-bar"></div>
  <p class="my-3 text-white/85 leading-relaxed"><a href="mailto:sebastien@developassion.be">sebastien@developassion.be</a>, or a post in the relevant Discussions space in Knowii (faster, and others learn from the answer).</p>
  </div>
</Base>
